ng for the full board\n\nYOUR MEMORIES, KEPT\n\nEvery completed activity becomes a memory: browse them as a photo collection or on a calendar, and look back at everything you've done together.\n\nMADE FOR TWO (OR MORE)\n\nSpinGo works great for couples, but just as well with your best friend, your flatmates, or your family. Run up to five boards at once — one for date nights, one for the summer, one with the kids.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\n\n• No account, no sign-up — open the app and start\n• Works completely offline — nothing you enter ever leaves your phone\n• No ads, no tracking, no analytics\n• Your photos stay in the app, on your device\n\nStop scrolling, start doing. Spin the wheel.", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "SpinGo", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "37054464", "formattedPrice": "무료", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/spingo/id6787754403?uo=4", "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 0}]}